{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2025-04", "window": 3, "start_date": 1744761600, "end_date": 1745366399, "month_true_total": 21, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:56:31 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "193369974", "author": {"steamid": "76561199196793414", "personaname": "Norwood 7", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199196793414/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 352, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 352, "last_played": 1721282074, "avatar": "0ec112ddd53611bcda445fcb7bf9a8c22044b9a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Friendly-Fire Simulator with legendary voice acting. Runs a bit like jank tho :(", "timestamp_created": 1745360816, "timestamp_updated": 1745360816, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504854321479797363", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193350138", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058482799", "personaname": "Weirden", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198058482799/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 3367, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 6, "playtime_at_review": 3361, "deck_playtime_at_review": 94, "last_played": 1789566539, "avatar": "6410fe435cb4823fd2c701d6df6d67c83619e095"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great co-op game.", "timestamp_created": 1745342958, "timestamp_updated": 1745342958, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193268472", "author": {"steamid": "76561199547672678", "personaname": "Moxa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199547672678/", "num_games_owned": 93, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2504, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2377, "last_played": 1751750027, "avatar": "78d9834a19df40b83e9024a9d42ba668a2ddbd3d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I want to say it's mindless fun but it isn't. Great time with your friends though mind the friendly fire (I play air raider, so after nuking my friend fort ge tenth time they don't believe I am sorry) \nLove killing bugs abd aliens. So if you are too sign right here! Though without a sale those games cost a bit too much imo", "timestamp_created": 1745245374, "timestamp_updated": 1745245374, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193218442", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054198906", "personaname": "ArtyMann", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198054198906/", "num_games_owned": 626, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 21758, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 185, "playtime_at_review": 19089, "last_played": 1790267859, "avatar": "fa0ae24797ba606f5f57ffbf74439d56dd3f5618"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best and most satisfying arcade games there is. You've got an amazing soundtrack, gameplay and balancing focused solely on fun, and cheesy over the top voice acting.", "timestamp_created": 1745183360, "timestamp_updated": 1745183360, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501872658729553223", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192985551", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012610173", "personaname": "Genoscythe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198012610173/", "num_games_owned": 1000, "num_reviews": 246, "playtime_forever": 3662, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2641, "last_played": 1745443297, "avatar": "9e0a16eede6f3c4463ff29cd37fee3eda4443d54"}, "language": "english", "review": "I didn't finish EDF 4.1, while not a bad game the progression felt somewhat wonky and one could tell it was quite dated. EDF 5 does exactly the same but has some really cool additions and adjustments for the classes. Air Raider calling in strikes is genius and makes the class feel a lot more unique. But you still don't get any real firearms and it feels like vehicle choices suck at certain parts of the game, but overall it was enormously fun to play. Fencer can choose to be even faster or heavier now, and Wing Diver and Ranger are both still solid and got some extra customization and gear choices.\n\nThe campaign is long, you get a really fun grind with lots of unlocks and coop fun if you have people to play with.\n\nThe game is currently listed at around 50 gold, is it worth that? If you intend to go for the full inferno grind, yes. I got this for like 12 gold and it was really worth the price.", "timestamp_created": 1744941211, "timestamp_updated": 1744941211, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513513505458831787", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}